**/output/*
**/outputs/*
**/videos/*
**/wandb/*
**/.neptune/*
docker/artifacts/
*.tmp

# Doc Outputs
**/docs/_build/*
**/generated/*

# Isaac-Sim packman
_isaac_sim*
_repo
_build
.lastformat

# RL-Games
**/runs/*
**/logs/*
**/recordings/*

# Teleop Recorded Dataset
datasets/*
!datasets/.gitkeep
teleop_traces/*

